WEBVTT

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:30.928
It's that ongoing brain chatter
that connects me and my internal world

00:05:30.952 --> 00:05:32.976
to my external world.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.766
It's that little voice that says to me,

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:39.578
"Hey, you've got to remember
to pick up bananas on your way home.

00:05:39.602 --> 00:05:40.976
I need them in the morning."

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.898
It's that calculating intelligence

00:05:42.922 --> 00:05:46.741
that reminds me
when I have to do my laundry.

00:05:46.765 --> 00:05:51.594
But perhaps most important,
it's that little voice that says to me,

00:05:51.618 --> 00:05:55.449
"I am. I am."

00:05:55.473 --> 00:05:59.468
And as soon as my left hemisphere
says to me "I am,"

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:01.106
I become separate.